(6462748, 960528, 114233, '<td valign="top">Oh the irony! Does a homeless man (living on the streets, just trying to survive from day to day, trying to keep warm (mind those toes!), living in the midst of filth, rubbish and disorder) even know about global warming? :-)<br/>You have managed to capture a special moment here and I hope the viewers see and understand the context in which this was shot. It is truly humbling to see someone like this and then think about what we have in life!<br/>(Not voting)</td>', 'Oh the irony! Does a homeless man (living on the streets, just trying to survive from day to day, trying to keep warm (mind those toes!), living in the midst of filth, rubbish and disorder) even know about global warming? :-)You have managed to capture a special moment here and I hope the viewers see and understand the context in which this was shot. It is truly humbling to see someone like this and then think about what we have in life!(Not voting)', '2011-07-06 07:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6462749, 960515, 129267, '<td valign="top">Photo: 6<br/>Story: 6<br/> <br/>This would have made an extremely wonderful shot had it been just a bit more low-key, in gray scale. I like the message and the framing, the shadows are nice. Not sure about the sunglasses, but I like the boots and the soccer ball.</td>', 'Photo: 6Story: 6 This would have made an extremely wonderful shot had it been just a bit more low-key, in gray scale. I like the message and the framing, the shadows are nice. Not sure about the sunglasses, but I like the boots and the soccer ball.', '2011-07-06 07:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6462753, 960502, 129267, '<td valign="top">photo: 5<br/>story: 7<br/> <br/>I like the feeling that this was captured right before the ''pop.'' I might have had more impact if the extra balloons weren''t in the frame, and maybe in black and white. Crop feels like there''s a lot of loose room on the left side.</td>', 'photo: 5story: 7 I like the feeling that this was captured right before the ''pop.'' I might have had more impact if the extra balloons weren''t in the frame, and maybe in black and white. Crop feels like there''s a lot of loose room on the left side.', '2011-07-06 07:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
