(6463541, 960269, 129267, '<td valign="top">photo:7<br/>story:7<br/> <br/>great expression, and stopped motion. great exposure considering the lighting difficulty. love the story, and the abstract interpretation.</td>', 'photo:7story:7 great expression, and stopped motion. great exposure considering the lighting difficulty. love the story, and the abstract interpretation.', '2011-07-06 20:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6463549, 960315, 129267, '<td valign="top">photo: 5<br/>story: 5<br/> <br/>I like the idea, but think it could have had a bit better of an execution. The focus is great, exposure isn''t bad - the darks are a bit dark on my monitor, but I''ll chalk that up to my monitor being cheap. I like the "off the beaten path" but wish there wasn''t so much haziness over the valley. The bike feels so isolated, I almost wish there was something a bit more interesting about the landscape.</td>', 'photo: 5story: 5 I like the idea, but think it could have had a bit better of an execution. The focus is great, exposure isn''t bad - the darks are a bit dark on my monitor, but I''ll chalk that up to my monitor being cheap. I like the "off the beaten path" but wish there wasn''t so much haziness over the valley. The bike feels so isolated, I almost wish there was something a bit more interesting about the landscape.', '2011-07-06 20:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6463553, 960657, 129267, '<td valign="top">photo: 5<br/>story: 5<br/> <br/>The exposure of this is nice, and it feels sharp. There are quite a few distracting poles/plant life that don''t really add anything to the meaning. The story feels a bit default, wish it would have felt more personal, or made a grander statement about life.</td>', 'photo: 5story: 5 The exposure of this is nice, and it feels sharp. There are quite a few distracting poles/plant life that don''t really add anything to the meaning. The story feels a bit default, wish it would have felt more personal, or made a grander statement about life.', '2011-07-06 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
