(6464446, 960672, 129267, '<td valign="top">photo: 7<br/>narrative/title: 6<br/> <br/>Took me a second to understand the narrative, and I''m only guessing at this point that the hat is a reference to the cross? I find it strange how deeply saturated the sky is, i think of warm colors when I think of desert environments. I almost wish that this was taken a bit farther back - it bothers me to see the sidewalk enter the frame from 3 different points.</td>', 'photo: 7narrative/title: 6 Took me a second to understand the narrative, and I''m only guessing at this point that the hat is a reference to the cross? I find it strange how deeply saturated the sky is, i think of warm colors when I think of desert environments. I almost wish that this was taken a bit farther back - it bothers me to see the sidewalk enter the frame from 3 different points.', '2011-07-07 20:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464447, 959895, 129267, '<td valign="top">photo: 6<br/>narrative/title: 6<br/> <br/>I think what makes this image so captivating is that the shadows appear to be holding hands. With that in mind, I do wish they weren''t cropped as much.</td>', 'photo: 6narrative/title: 6 I think what makes this image so captivating is that the shadows appear to be holding hands. With that in mind, I do wish they weren''t cropped as much.', '2011-07-07 20:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
