(6466162, 960713, 34059, '<td valign="top">You are a genius. I hope people understand this. I think that the scope of this challenge was to tell a whole story in six words and complete it with an image. Most people just gave a six word title to the photo. Others told an episode. This, in my opinion, is the only long, complete, misterious, thrilling story of the challenge, exceptionally complemented by the most appropriate picture, where the blur adds so much to the whole story. I didn''t want to vote on this challenge, but I''m going to just to give you a valid 10. My compliments.</td>', 'You are a genius. I hope people understand this. I think that the scope of this challenge was to tell a whole story in six words and complete it with an image. Most people just gave a six word title to the photo. Others told an episode. This, in my opinion, is the only long, complete, misterious, thrilling story of the challenge, exceptionally complemented by the most appropriate picture, where the blur adds so much to the whole story. I didn''t want to vote on this challenge, but I''m going to just to give you a valid 10. My compliments.', '2011-07-09 08:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
