(6467090, 960255, 18367, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this image, but had no idea at to who was St. Florian.  Thanks for the education.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Absolutely love this image, but had no idea at to who was St. Florian.  Thanks for the education.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2011-07-10 18:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467091, 960006, 125275, '<td valign="top">Interestingly done. I''m just flipping through, gonna vote later, but this is nice!</td>', 'Interestingly done. I''m just flipping through, gonna vote later, but this is nice!', '2011-07-10 18:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467094, 960611, 18367, '<td valign="top">I am not usually swayed by images such as this, but this is the second image I have encountered so far in this Challenge that I truly like. The best of luck to you in the challenge. I know the Posthumous crowd will never believe this, but I gave this a ten... it spoke to me... saying ... give me a ten.</td>', 'I am not usually swayed by images such as this, but this is the second image I have encountered so far in this Challenge that I truly like. The best of luck to you in the challenge. I know the Posthumous crowd will never believe this, but I gave this a ten... it spoke to me... saying ... give me a ten.', '2011-07-10 18:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467149, 960610, 82545, '<td valign="top">I''m rocking a high score for this one cause low votes makes me angry too!...and it''s a good photo also.</td>', 'I''m rocking a high score for this one cause low votes makes me angry too!...and it''s a good photo also.', '2011-07-10 20:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467160, 960238, 82545, '<td valign="top">This pic is definitely right up my alley, but it appears to be HDR or a really vivid filter and I''m thinking that''s beyond the basic challenge rules. Still really like it though. If it''s not HDR I''d really like to know how it was shot/edited.</td>', 'This pic is definitely right up my alley, but it appears to be HDR or a really vivid filter and I''m thinking that''s beyond the basic challenge rules. Still really like it though. If it''s not HDR I''d really like to know how it was shot/edited.', '2011-07-10 20:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
