(6467315, 960530, 38032, '<td valign="top">fun to look at =} 7</td>', 'fun to look at =} 7', '2011-07-11 00:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467472, 960202, 60862, '<td valign="top">THANK YOU for actually writing a memoir and then illustrating it with a photo. And it''s a really nice photo with a great vintage feel, clearly connecting to the idea of an adult remembering childhood road trips.  In fact, this is getting a 10 from me for both the memoir and the photo.</td>', 'THANK YOU for actually writing a memoir and then illustrating it with a photo. And it''s a really nice photo with a great vintage feel, clearly connecting to the idea of an adult remembering childhood road trips.  In fact, this is getting a 10 from me for both the memoir and the photo.', '2011-07-11 02:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467473, 960036, 60862, '<td valign="top">I guess the idea is you drowned yourself?  If so, footsteps leading into the water would''ve sold it more than footsteps leading off the right side of the image.  I''m also not clear you would''ve stacked up your boxes and laid your cameras out so neatly.  So - a good concept, nicely done memoir, but some details aren''t meshing for me.</td>', 'I guess the idea is you drowned yourself?  If so, footsteps leading into the water would''ve sold it more than footsteps leading off the right side of the image.  I''m also not clear you would''ve stacked up your boxes and laid your cameras out so neatly.  So - a good concept, nicely done memoir, but some details aren''t meshing for me.', '2011-07-11 02:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467475, 960570, 60862, '<td valign="top">It seems to me the memoir should be about you, the photographer, as opposed to the bird, but at least you connected the title to a story.  As for the photo, I have a few concerns, but you can decide whether they''re worth your worrying about: the bird doesn''t seem as sharp as the branches in between it and the camera, the composition feels a little unbalanced - try it with most of the left side cropped out, and the colors seem a little green.</td>', 'It seems to me the memoir should be about you, the photographer, as opposed to the bird, but at least you connected the title to a story.  As for the photo, I have a few concerns, but you can decide whether they''re worth your worrying about: the bird doesn''t seem as sharp as the branches in between it and the camera, the composition feels a little unbalanced - try it with most of the left side cropped out, and the colors seem a little green.', '2011-07-11 02:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467478, 960176, 60862, '<td valign="top">A fun, high-energy image.  However, the title strikes me as a saying, not a memoir.</td>', 'A fun, high-energy image.  However, the title strikes me as a saying, not a memoir.', '2011-07-11 02:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467480, 960152, 60862, '<td valign="top">I love the dreamy feel, the nostalgic colors, and the pose, which makes her seem to be drifting on the wind.  But I don''t get why her face is covered. Still a 7, but with her face showing, a point or two higher.</td>', 'I love the dreamy feel, the nostalgic colors, and the pose, which makes her seem to be drifting on the wind.  But I don''t get why her face is covered. Still a 7, but with her face showing, a point or two higher.', '2011-07-11 02:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467481, 960581, 60862, '<td valign="top">Fun image and title, but the title doesn''t strike me as a memoir.</td>', 'Fun image and title, but the title doesn''t strike me as a memoir.', '2011-07-11 02:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467484, 960023, 60862, '<td valign="top">Lovely streaky effect.  How''d you do it in the camera?  The title would connect better for me with a little more easily-seen duo in the middle.</td>', 'Lovely streaky effect.  How''d you do it in the camera?  The title would connect better for me with a little more easily-seen duo in the middle.', '2011-07-11 02:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6467486, 960569, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot, although I''m not sure the title is a memoir.<br/> <br/>On a side note, it''s interesting how the colors in your direct image are so different from the ones on the screen!  Shows how hard it is to match display colors to reality.</td>', 'Nice action shot, although I''m not sure the title is a memoir. On a side note, it''s interesting how the colors in your direct image are so different from the ones on the screen!  Shows how hard it is to match display colors to reality.', '2011-07-11 02:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
