(6468204, 960524, 56502, '<td valign="top">Great pregnancy shot. I''m curious about the comments on your caption :-)</td>', 'Great pregnancy shot. I''m curious about the comments on your caption :-)', '2011-07-12 03:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6468222, 960515, 114233, '<td valign="top">I like the framing of the trees and the composition. Something I have learnt on DPC is that it generally scores better if the subject is a bit lighter than the surroundings because the eye is drawn towards lighter objects. Your sky is a little too bright and maybe takes some of the emphasis off of the person. I do understand that the scene you photographed is quite difficult especially under basic editing because of the bright sky and also the darker shadows. Keep it up - I see potential!</td>', 'I like the framing of the trees and the composition. Something I have learnt on DPC is that it generally scores better if the subject is a bit lighter than the surroundings because the eye is drawn towards lighter objects. Your sky is a little too bright and maybe takes some of the emphasis off of the person. I do understand that the scene you photographed is quite difficult especially under basic editing because of the bright sky and also the darker shadows. Keep it up - I see potential!', '2011-07-12 06:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6468396, 960650, 92577, '<td valign="top">terrific</td>', 'terrific', '2011-07-12 14:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
